 Face 发布 Granite Switch 4.1.1 增量更新","summary":"Hugging Face 发布 Granite Switch 4.1.1 增量更新，适配器支持多语言语音转文本（10种语言）并优化决策模型性能。基础模型未改动，开发者可通过适配器SDK和教程构建自定义适配器，实现类似软件的版本迭代部署。","sourceName":"Hugging Face Blog","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/ibm-granite/granite-switch-4-1-1","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T13:37:07.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/8fa81ac2ff0525230e8911420f78dddc59d19d1503d8084f830acaedebb138ee.webp 48w, /hot-pages/aihot/data/media/21ae6435c9b2b5dab89547d94a7eab806572a59961a2504ed6cb8711467c44b0.webp 96w","itemId":"tm3naxy0lx83g9mcapcbmy7cw","title":"Google AI搜索问题致市值蒸发10% 财报揭示云业务增长103%","summary":"Google AI搜索问题导致市值蒸发10%，云业务收入同比增长103%至307亿美元。AI搜索查询增长但 monetization 较低，传统搜索仍保持增长。财报显示搜索广告收入增长12%至634亿美元，YouTube广告收入增长9%至112亿美元。CEO Sundar Pichai称Gemini用户达10亿，并计划推出轻量化Carbon模型。","sourceName":"The Decoder","sourceUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/googles-ai-search-problem-finally-shows-up-in-the-earnings-report-some-investors-believe/","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T10:16:34.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}]},{"label":"论文研究","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":"usbbtoxrm0qhn3ye0pa51eazl","title":"微软研究聚焦第97期：AI智能体优化与天气预测模型升级","summary":"微软研究播客第97期发布，涵盖AI智能体优化框架ForkPilot（在六项基准测试中性能接近现有最佳方法且降低59%计算需求）、通过活动日志学习技能的TeleTune框架，以及蛋白质建模工具BioEmu2的公开预览。研究显示企业AI使用存在20%高频编辑文档的共性，但深入分析后行业间需求差异显著。","sourceName":"Microsoft Research","sourceUrl":"https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/podcast/microsoft-research-focus-edition-97/","publishedAt":"2026-10-29T19:19:16.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true}]},{"label":"技巧与观点","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/af1846974b2b34d35b288b0e5b0b6535a88f197ba92653c057daca25bfa3bd9f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/aihot/data/media/c46d0ade22dfac4500486e6b9fe578a12b5b29f4700a8185057ce805e7bc1ee7.webp 48w, /hot-pa